    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense, but if you had to pick a primary driver for the narrative, wouldn't it be the tech itself? i mean, even if politicians try to slow it down, the fundamental R&D and the sheer efficiency of AI seem to exist on a trajectory that's basically out of human control. isn't \"technological determinism\" actually the more realistic way to look at it?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
