      "content": "That perspective points toward a powerful form of structural determinism shaped by global capital flows. In a competitive, interconnected world, the spread of disruptive technology often outpaces regulatory capacity. Therefore, the narrative could effectively focus on the tension between inevitable technological velocity and the lagging, patchwork responses of governance. This allows you to explore how humanity is caught between an upward technological tide and its imperfect attempts to steer its course.",
      "source": "target",
